"[生产 receiver](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32u575/drivers/lpdma_copy.c) 与[具体 "
"Stop2](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32u575/stop2.c) 通过 typed compile-time profile 共享不变量；两个公共"
" request/ops 类型保持独立。[维护的公共 C11 consumer](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
